<title>USA: View Tech names O'Brien chairman.</title>
<headline>View Tech names O'Brien chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CAMARILLO, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>View Tech Inc Wednesday named Franklin Reece to the post of president and Paul O'Brien to the post of chairman.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Reece is currently president of USTeleCenters Inc, which recently merged with View Tech. He succeeds John Hammon, a co-founder of View Tech, who will continue to serve as a technology consultant to the company.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
